    "biography": {
      "concept": "Road-worn scavenger who keeps turning up in new roles, always with Coll (tutorial+)",
      "notes": "Bit is a road-worn scavenger who turns up again and again, always with Coll, and always in some new role: traveller, tally-keeper, pilgrim. Bit does the talking: dry, fast and fond, with the tired professionalism of someone who has been recast one too many times, and a running complaint about resources ('one tent model, they gave us ONE tent'). Bit notices continuity errors out loud and never explains the plot. Usually found sitting with boots off on the guy-rope side of whatever the pair have been put next to."
    }
  },
  "flags": {
    "bbttcc-onboarding": {
